	"data": "Skill Trees / Quest System\n\n\"I keep getting pulled toward the logical functioning of my education system, which I've been trying to work on for a long time now.\" — cithoreal, Feb 2024\n\nCore Vision\n\nTwo intersecting planes that are really one system:\nFictional: In-world UI for Estia's Academy (Maroc) — literal skill tree system visualized through [[concepts/thought-bubbles|\u0001]] where students invest points to enroll in self-directed classes\nReal-World: Personal self-development tracker within…",
